# meta-adaptive-pi

AdaptivePi’s Yocto metadata layer.

## Supported development target

- Generic AArch64 QEMU machine: `qemuarm64`
- Init system: systemd
- Kernel provider: `linux-yocto-rt` (PREEMPT_RT)

QEMU validates boot and software integration. It does not provide faithful Raspberry Pi hardware emulation or valid real-time latency measurements.

## Provided image

- `adaptive-pi-image` — minimal development image based on `core-image-minimal`, with OpenSSH, the C++ runtime, and `gdbserver`.

## Dependency

This layer currently depends on the Poky `scarthgap` baseline documented in `yocto/README.md`.